      "body": "Thanks for looking into this. The doc change would help clarify things, but I’d prefer a change where the parser  accepts `unix,max-connections=x`, with a test for it. Since `unix` already works for the default socket, I don’t see much benefit in requiring a colon just to limit the max connections. Supporting both forms would also make the existing help text work as written.",
